# Line endings are fixed here, not by each machine's core.autocrlf: text is stored and checked out as LF, and the
# Windows-native files as CRLF (cmd misreads LF batch files). Binaries are detected and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.vcxproj text eol=crlf
